d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">ELEMENTFALL IS OFFICIALLY PLAYABLE ON YOUR SHELLFIRE GAMES WEBSITE!</span></span></p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">🎮 **</span><span class="Trigger-Ddd7Wy" data-d-component="popover-trigger" data-d-inline="" data-d-inline-text="" role="presentation" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><a class="" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" href="https://shellfiregames.com/play/**?utm_source=chatgpt.com"><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">https://shellfiregames.com/play/**</span></span><span class="ms-1" data-d-stream-inline=""><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-LhowAj" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.243 6.757a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7.072a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4.657L8.464 16.95a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l6.778-6.779H9.172a1 1 0 0 1 0-2h7.07Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a></span></p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">You've now got:</span></p><ul class="List-GOP23i" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">✅ Elementfall running in a web browser.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">✅ Unity game files hosted on Cloudflare.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">✅ A playable page on your own domain.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">✅ No downloads or installations required.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">✅ The ability to publish future game updates.</span></p></div></div></li></ul><h3 class="TextBase-qM5iDq Title-mwq_Iy" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Next step — Add a Play button</span></h3><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Now let's make sure visitors to </span><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">shellfiregames.com</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> can easily find the game.</span></p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">We can add a big </span><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">PLAY ELEMENTFALL</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> button to your homepage that takes players directly to </span><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">/play/</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">.</span></p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Want to do that next?</span></span></p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 button-icon flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.468 10.4107 13.468 9.91717 13.4367 9.53369C13.4137 9.25191 13.3758 9.0622 13.3244 8.91846L13.2687 8.78858C13.1148 8.48652 12.8803 8.23344 12.593 8.05713L12.466 7.98584C12.308 7.90546 12.0963 7.84854 11.7209 7.81787C11.3374 7.78656 10.8439 7.78662 10.133 7.78662H7.29999C6.58895 7.78662 6.09562 7.78654 5.7121 7.81787C5.43015 7.84091 5.24064 7.87872 5.09686 7.93018L4.96698 7.98584C4.66487 8.13977 4.41184 8.37419 4.23554 8.66162L4.16522 8.78858C4.08477 8.94657 4.02794 9.15811 3.99725 9.53369C3.96594 9.91718 3.96503 10.4107 3.96503 11.1216V13.9546C3.96503 14.6656 3.96592 15.159 3.99725 15.5425C4.02796 15.9182 4.08471 16.1296 4.16522 16.2876L4.23554 16.4136C4.41185 16.7012 4.66472 16.9353 4.96698 17.0894L5.09686 17.146C5.24061 17.1974 5.43024 17.2343 5.7121 17.2573C6.09562 17.2887 6.58895