data-d-size="sm" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(93, 93, 93);">A large game image above the description, with a </span><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(93, 93, 93);">Play Now</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(93, 93, 93);"> button underneath. Clicking either the image or button opens the game.</span></p></div><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">We'll keep your website's existing dark design and orange accents.</span></p><h3 class="TextBase-qM5iDq Title-mwq_Iy" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Step 1 — Open your homepage code</span></h3><ol class="List-GOP23i" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Go to your Shellfire Games GitHub repository.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Click the main </span><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">index.html</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> file (not the one inside </span><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">play</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">).</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Click the </span><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-LhowAj" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);" data-d-stream-inline=""><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M13.2929 4.29291C15.0641 2.52167 17.9359 2.52167 19.7071 4.2929C21.4784 6.06414 21.4784 8.93588 19.7071 10.7071L18.7073 11.7069L11.6135 18.8007C10.8766 19.5376 9.92793 20.0258 8.89999 20.1971L4.16441 20.9864C3.84585 21.0395 3.52127 20.9355 3.29291 20.7071C3.06454 20.4788 2.96053 20.1542 3.01362 19.8356L3.80288 15.1C3.9742 14.0721 4.46243 13.1234 5.19932 12.3865L13.2929 4.29291ZM13 7.41422L6.61353 13.8007C6.1714 14.2428 5.87846 14.8121 5.77567 15.4288L5.21656 18.7835L8.57119 18.2244C9.18795 18.1216 9.75719 17.8286 10.1993 17.3865L16.5858 11L13 7.41422ZM18 9.5858L14.4142 6.00001L14.7071 5.70712C15.6973 4.71693 17.3027 4.71693 18.2929 5.70712C19.2831 6.69731 19.2831 8.30272 18.2929 9.29291L18 9.5858Z"></path></svg> <span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Edit</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> button.</span></p></div></div></li></ol><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Once you're there, send me your current </span><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">index.html</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> code.</span></span></p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">I'll modify it so the Elementfall picture links to </span><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">https://shellfiregames.com/play/</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">, without messing up the rest of your website.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_