x-icon-arrow-up-open-base-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 button-icon flex items-center justify-center p-0.5 outline-hidden cursor-interaction" aria-label="Regenerate response" id="radix-_r_412_" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/startup-v2/optimized/assets/icons-ce864f3a72c8e66e.svg#codex-icon-arrows-clockwise-rotate-lg-light-16" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><button type="button" class="Button-BZrLNX outline-hidden cursor-interaction" data-color="secondary" data-variant="ghost" data-uniform="" data-size="sm" data-icon-size="sm" aria-label="More actions" id="radix-_r_404_" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><span class="ButtonInner-Ku4XvS"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/startup-v2/optimized/assets/icons-ce864f3a72c8e66e.svg#codex-icon-ellipsis-horizontal-light-16" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="" style="margin-top: 12px; height: 1825.6px;"><div class="[&amp;_[data-virtualized-turn-content]]:[content-visibility:visible]" data-turn-key="f54fc99b-3aee-43da-a3f9-008ecba29a10"><div data-content-search-turn-key="fallback-turn-103"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><div class="group flex flex-col" data-talvt-turn-state="complete"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 browser:gap-1"><div class="block-BQZwFn"><h4 class="sr-only m-0 select-none print:not-sr-only print:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary" data-conversation-role="user"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">You said:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">You</span></h4><div class="group/user-message flex flex-col items-end gap-2" data-chatgpt-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-103:0:user" data-chatgpt-search-message-ids="f54fc99b-3aee-43da-a3f9-008ecba29a10"><div class="w-full" data-content-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-103:0:user"><div class="group/user-message flex w-full flex-col gap-1 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:items-start items-end"><div data-user-message-bubble="true" class="bg-user-message text-user-message min-w-0 max-w-(--user-chat-width) overflow-hidden break-words px-(--thread-content-margin) [&amp;_.contain-inline-size]:[contain:initial] bubble-vBnidZ py-2.5 rounded-2xl relative text-start"><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative w-full min-w-0 text-size-chat leading-relaxed"><div class="overflow-hidden" data-search-result-target="" style="max-height: 19lh;"><div><div class="text-size-chat whitespace-pre-wrap" dir="auto">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
  &lt;meta charset="UTF-8"&gt;
  &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"&gt;
  &lt;meta name="description" content="ShellFire Games - Independent Game Development Studio"&gt;
  &lt;title&gt;ShellFire Games | Official Website&lt;/title&gt;

  &lt;style&gt;
    :root {
      --bg: #080a0e;
      --panel: #141820;
      --orange: #ff7938;
      --gold: #ffbc67;
      --text: #f5f5f7;
      --muted: #a4aab5;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
    }

    /* NAVIGATION */

    nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 25px;
      padding: 14px 7%;
      background: rgba(8, 10, 14, 0.93);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff12;
      backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 19px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .brand span {
      color: var(--orange);
    }

    .nav-logo {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 26px;
    }

    .links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #d5d5da;
      font-size: 14px;
      transition: color 0.25s;
    }

    .links a:hover {
      color: var(--orange);
    }

    /* HERO */

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 92vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 90px 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        radial-gradient(
          ellipse at 50% 90%,
          #522318 0%,
          #21131a 38%,
          #080a0e 78%
        );
    }

    .fire-glow {
      position: absolute;
      width: 600px;
      height: 450px;
      background: #ff5b22;
      opacity: 0.13;
      filter: blur(130px);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: glowPulse 5s infinite alternate;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    @keyframes glowPulse {
      from {
        transform: scale(0.85);
        opacity: 0.10;
      }

      to {
        transform: scale(1.25);
        opacity: 0.23;
      }
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      animation: fadeUp 1.1s ease both;
    }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(35px);
      }

      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    /* MAIN LOGO */

    .hero-logo {
      display: block;
      width: min(400px, 82vw);
      height: auto;
      max-height: 380px;
      object-fit: contain;
      margin: 0 auto 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      filter: drop-shadow(
        0 0 35px rgba(255, 95, 30, 0.28)
      );
      animation: logoFloat 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes logoFloat {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      50% {
        transform: translateY(-13px);
      }
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--orange);
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(48px, 9vw, 105px);
      letter-spacing: -3px;
      line-height: 1;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    h1 span {
      color: var(--orange);
    }

    .hero-description {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* BUTTONS */

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        #ffad57,
        #ff642c
      );
      color: #160d08;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 35px #ff642c55;
    }

    /* ANIMATED EMBERS */

    .embers {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .ember {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -20px;
      width: 4px;
      height: 4px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--gold);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--orange);
      animation: emberRise linear infinite;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    @keyframes emberRise {
      0% {
        transform: translateY(0);
        opacity: 0;
      }

      15% {
        opacity: 0.8;
      }

      85% {
        opacity: 0.6;
      }

      100% {
        transform: translateY(-95vh);
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }

    /* CONTENT */

    .content {
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 110px 25px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 44px);
      margin: 16px 0;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    /* GAME CARDS */

    .game-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(
        auto-fit,
        minmax(260px, 1fr)
      );
      gap: 25px;
      margin-top: 42px;
    }

    .game-card {
      position: relative;
      background: linear-gradient(
        150deg,
        #1e222d,
        #11141b
      );
      border: 1px solid #34313a;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 40px 32px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: 0.35s;
    }

    .game-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        transparent,
        var(--orange),
        transparent
      );
    }

    .game-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      border-color: var(--orange);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 45px #0008;
    }

    .game-card h3 {
      font-size: 29px;
      margin: 18px 0;
    }

    .game-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .tag {
      color: var(--orange);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* ABOUT */

    .about-panel {
      background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        #1a1b24,
        #101218
      );
      border: 1px solid #ffffff12;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 45px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    /* CONTACT */

    .contact {
      text-align: center;
      background:
        radial-gradient(
          ellipse at bottom,
          #341b17,
          #11141b 70%
        );
      padding: 100px 20px;
    }

    .contact .subtitle {
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
    }

    .email-address {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 25px;
      color: var(--orange);
      font-size: clamp(15px, 3vw, 21px);
      text-decoration: none;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .email-address:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .contact-note {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    /* FOOTER */

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 35px 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #ffffff12;
      color: #828792;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    /* SCROLL ANIMATIONS */

    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px);
      transition:
        opacity 0.8s ease,
        transform 0.8s ease;
    }

    .reveal.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    /* MOBILE */

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      nav {
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 15px;
      }

      .links {
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 80vh;
        padding: 70px 20px;
      }

      .hero-logo {
        width: min(290px, 80vw);
      }

      .about-panel {
        padding: 25px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 75px 20px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        animation: none !important;
        transition: none !important;
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      }

      .reveal {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: none;
      }
    }
  &lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;

&lt;body&gt;

  &lt;!-- NAVIGATION --&gt;

  &lt;nav&gt;
    &lt;a href="#home" class="brand"&gt;
      &lt;img
        src="shellfire-logo.png"
        alt=""
        class="nav-logo"
      &gt;
      &lt;div&gt;
        SHELL&lt;span&gt;FIRE&lt;/span&gt; GAMES
      &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;

    &lt;div class="links"&gt;
      &lt;a href="#home"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;
      &lt;a href="#games"&gt;Games&lt;/a&gt;
      &lt;a href="#about"&gt;About&lt;/a&gt;
      &lt;a href="#contact"&gt;Contact&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/nav&gt;

  &lt;!-- HERO --&gt;

  &lt;header class="hero" id="home"&gt;
    &lt;div class="fire-glow"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class="embers" id="embers"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class="hero-content"&gt;

      &lt;img
        src="shellfire-logo.png"
        alt="ShellFire Games turtle logo"
        class="hero-logo"
      &gt;

      &lt;div class="eyebrow"&gt;
        INDEPENDENT GAME DEVELOPMENT STUDIO
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;h1&gt;
        SHELL&lt;span&gt;FIRE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
        GAMES
      &lt;/h1&gt;

      &lt;p class="hero-description"&gt;
        Forging new worlds. Creating unforgettable
        experiences. Welcome to ShellFire Games,
        where imagination meets innovation.
      &lt;/p&gt;

      &lt;a href="#games" class="button"&gt;
        Explore Our Games
      &lt;/a&gt;

    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/header&gt;

  &lt;!-- OUR GAMES --&gt;

