nt:leading-normal print:font-bold print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">ChatGPT said:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">ChatGPT</span></h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="6ae90e24-82cc-83ea-88ef-71f6a0277828" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="8d6acdef-1a0c-4dcf-856e-9819aed45dd2"><span hidden=""></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_40h_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="8d6acdef-1a0c-4dcf-856e-9819aed45dd2" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="1" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="8d6acdef-1a0c-4dcf-856e-9819aed45dd2"><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Great, I have your entire homepage code. We can keep the existing design and make the </span><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Elementfall card clickable</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">, with a game image and a </span><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">PLAY NOW</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> button.</span></p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">I recommend using your actual Elementfall logo or a screenshot from the game rather than unrelated fantasy artwork.</span></p><h3 class="TextBase-qM5iDq Title-mwq_Iy" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Step 1 — Upload your Elementfall image</span></h3><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Before we change the code:</span></p><ol class="List-GOP23i" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Go to your GitHub repository.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Click </span><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Add file → Upload files</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Upload an Elementfall logo, banner, or gameplay screenshot.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Rename it to </span><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">elementfall-banner.png</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> before uploading, if possible.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-LQC0tB" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-j6RkmC"><div class="Label-xkRseQ" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Click </span><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Commit changes</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">.</span></p></div></div></li></ol><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">We'll then update the homepage to display it like this:</span></p><div class="Box-IGz62a" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div class="Box-IGz62a" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-clip="true" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg);"><div class="Box-IGz62a" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-clip="true" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-height="" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); height: auto; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0px; width: 100%;"><div class="Image-ZGWcOW OverlayBox-NDn8wp LoadingFrame-SiXPxc group/search-image" data-d-component="image" data