-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Enter a world of elemental strategy. Build powerful decks, summon creatures, capture territory, and outsmart your opponents in tactical turn-based battles.</span></p><div class="Box-IGz62a" data-d-align="start" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col"><button type="button" class="Button-MckCnJ Button-Ng7lPh" data-color="primary" data-variant="solid" data-pill="" data-size="lg" data-d-component="button"><span class="ButtonInner-okLAMd"><span>PLAY NOW </span><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-LhowAj" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.243 6.757a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7.072a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4.657L8.464 16.95a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l6.778-6.779H9.172a1 1 0 0 1 0-2h7.07Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></button></div><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Caption-gLfLCM" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="caption" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="normal"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(93, 93, 93);">Layout preview — we'll use your own uploaded image on the website.</span></span></div><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Both the image and Play Now button will link to </span><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">shellfiregames.com/play/</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">.</span></p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Tell me when you've uploaded the image</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">, and I'll give you the complete updated </span><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">index.html</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> code, keeping the rest of your homepage intact.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 button-icon flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.468 10.4107 13.468 9.91717 13.4367 9.53369C13.4137 9.25191 13.3758 9.0622 13.3244 8.91846L13.2687 8.78858C13.1148 8.48652 12.8803 8.23344 12.593 8.05713